ffused daylight into the room. Along the upper-right edge, three open wooden shelves hold a row of glass jars and a stack of blue-and-white ceramic bowls, their handwritten labels too small to read. The centre of the frame is filled by the woman, leaning over the sink in three-quarter profile, mid-motion. Her dark hair is gathered into a loose low bun with a few strands loose at the temple and the nape of her neck, and she wears thin round gold wire-framed glasses, their bridge and one temple arm clearly visible, the arm tucking behind her ear, the lenses catching only a faint sliver of window reflection. She wears no visible makeup beyond a soft matte lip colour. She is dressed in a cropped charcoal-grey yoga top with thin shoulder straps and matching high-waisted leggings; as she leans forward the top has ridden up, exposing a sliver of bare midriff and her navel above the waistband, the fabric matte and creased at the waist. At this instant she has just noticed the camera: her head is turned toward the lens over her shoulder, her eyes meeting it squarely with a caught-off-guard, faintly startled and half-amused look, soap suds still dripping from one hand. In the lower-left corner, a white ceramic sink holds warm water and pale foam, her forearms submerged to the wrist among the dishes. Across the lower third, the countertop is a dark speckled quartz surface scattered with rinsed bowls, a bundle of bamboo chopsticks lying parallel to the front edge, and a small puddle of water catching a bright reflection. In the lower-right corner, a folded grey cotton dish towel sits beside a slatted bamboo drying rack holding three upright bowls. Behind her to the right, a stainless steel kettle and a ceramic teapot on the hob sit far out of focus, and the doorframe edge in the near foreground stays soft and out of focus. The lighting is soft, even daylight arriving from the window on the left and falling across her shoulder and the side of her face, catching the upper rim of her glasses; it leaves gentle specular highlights on the wet ceramic and a low-contrast shadow on the cabinet fronts to her right. The overall composition feels like a stolen handheld snapshot taken from cover, slightly tilted and framed by the foreground obstruction, and the mood is private, unguarded and caught in the act.\n,mxlz"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 508, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "智能体提示词", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [802], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "CLIP", "links": [801], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [618.5875854492188, 317.4604187011719], "pos": [-75.2120590209961, 2016.0933837890625], "widgets_values": ["qwen-image2.1-mxlz_c1-st6000.safetensors", 0.8800000000000001, "qwen21_detail_slider_v2.safetensors", 1.0000000000000002, "None", 0, "None", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 799, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "clip", "link": 800, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_01"}, "name": "lora_01", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA_01"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_01"}, "name": "strength_01", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "强度_01"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_02"}, "name": "lora_02", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA_02"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_02"}, "name": "strength_02", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "强度_02"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_03"}, "name": "lora_03", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA_03"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_03"}, "name": "strength_03", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "强度_03"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_04"}, "name": "lora_04", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoR